{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、真夏\nお誕生日おめぺろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/20/4661057/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて\nいきなり本題に入りますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪、染めてしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/20/4661057/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりわかんないですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんなら毛先の方は\n染める前から明るかったから\n逆に暗くなったかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田ママに言わせれば\n中田のちっちゃい頃の髪色に戻った\nって感じらしいですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n昔の中田生誕の乃木どこ見てた方は\n覚えてるのかなー？\n染めてないのに髪が明るかったってやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"染めた理由は、と聞かれれば\n関東で握手会の部数が減ってしまったのが\n一番のきっかけです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近で一番ショックでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/20/4661057/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶髪なら人気でる\nとか思ってないけど\n何かアクションを起こしたかったんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にみなさんが離れていくのが\n本当に怖い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田自身\n黒髪ロング一筋だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗は怖いかもしれないけど\n何もしなきゃ変わらない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じのことを\n最近、本で見たばっかりでして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影響されやすいんですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は地毛が好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの反応とか見て\nまた戻しちゃうかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ\n良い選択だったと思ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあそんなに\n言うほど変わってないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに\n中田が黒髪に拘ってたのは\n黒髪こそ清楚の象徴だと思っていたからだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が\n彼氏がいない歴21年という事実は変わらないので\n安心してください(・∀・)ﾊｲﾃﾏｽﾖ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、 一応言っとくけど\n彼女もいたことありませんので\n安心してください(・∀・)ﾊｲﾃﾏｽﾖ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし良ければ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のこと\n見捨てないでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/20/4661057/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}